# --- Private application materials (never publish) ---
# Note: docs/planning/ is intentionally tracked (planning notes + AI-generated
# reports live there on purpose). These filename patterns still protect the
# actual resume/cover-letter/screenshot files by name, wherever they land.
*.docx
*Cover Letter*
*Resume*
*Vanderbilt University*.png

# --- Private working docs (never publish) ---
docs/project-journal.md
docs/decisions-log.md
docs/landscape-scan.md
docs/project-brief.md
docs/START-HERE.md
docs/recap/

# --- Personal-only material (study notes, not project deliverables) ---
personal/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Tableau large extracts (keep the .twbx workbook, drop heavy extracts) ---
*.hyper
*.tde

# --- Firecrawl cache ---
.firecrawl/
data/raw/labor_raw/*.md

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
~$*

# --- Local Claude Code permissions (machine-specific, not project content) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
